    "title": "Photo Edit, Background Changer",
    "description": "Background Changer: Photo Edit is a beautiful app that has; \r\n\r\n\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f <b>Background Changer</b>\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 <b>Collage Maker</b>, \r\n\ud83d\udcaa <b>Body Resizer</b>, \r\nfeatures.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f <b>Background Changer, Remove BG</b>\r\n\r\nHave ever been to London? Don't worry we can edit your photos and you look like you have been anywhere. You just need to choose your photo and change the photo's background to anything you like with our  background eraser.\r\n\r\nMoreover changing the picture\u2019s background we can let you remove the photo\u2019s background. Besides, you can do it with one click. It is free to do and easy to comprehend. Our technology remove background eraser will guide you to succeed easily.You can also use object remover for removing objects.\r\n\r\nFrom now on everyone can be any place on earth. With his/her great picture he/she can be in the best place he/her would like to be. Now, every day is a great post opportunity for social media. \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 <b>Collage Maker</b>, \r\n\r\nYou have the best 2 or 3 pictures you want to combine with. But you don't have the best tools to apply it. Now you just need to open our app and choose your amazing photos. After that, you just need to wait seconds to finish collaging. It will take only seconds. \r\n\r\nYou and your girlfriend/boyfriend would like to post a photo with you side by side. Nevertheless, you want to save time and finish it as quickly as possible. Our app will grant you more time than you will ever need. You will have the best result after using our app.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcaa <b>Body Resizer</b>, \r\n\r\nDefinitely, the most intriguing material of humans is faces and bodies. You can edit photos' lights for your face but you can't edit your bodies not so easily. But our free & best app will let you edit your bodies however you like.\r\n\r\nYou can narrow your belly with a great golden ratio, you can enlarge your breasts for catching everybody's attention, enhance your hips for having a unique look, and add muscles for impressing different people on social media. After sharing posts on social media everybody will envy you \ud83d\ude09\r\n\r\nThis mesmerizing photo effect editor makes it possible to change your background and remove it in easy steps. All you have to do is take a picture by using your selfie or normal camera. Our app will do the rest. Besides, it is free.\r\n\r\nEvery phone has a portrait camera. But with using our app your pictures have become more vivid. Because our tools are the best and free. Besides, you can use our editor tools in this beautiful changing face app at no cost, and guess it is easy to use.\r\n\r\nWe all have beautiful combinable pictures. Always we want to improve its quality and makes it look wonderful together. There is a chance for you. This free and beautiful app helps you to make collages from amazing photos.\r\n\r\nYou can create mesmerizing results by using face editor in our wonderful <b>Background Changer: Photo Edit</b> app. While using the <b>Background Changer: Photo Edit</b> app, you can see lots of photo art filters, don't hesitate to use them. Because the result may surprise you. Additionally, you can use amazing filters not only in solid color but also in gradient colors.\r\n\r\nPlease be a part of this experience; download, and enjoy this beautiful <b>Background Changer: Photo Edit</b> app. We will always try to update our app, with new features. Also If you have something in your mind, please be in touch with us for your demands about this app and find out the bugs. Enjoy and have fun.",
